  "notes": "The compiler builds the whole tree since ontology round R9 (DESIGN_ATOM_ONTOLOGY §13, gate round 9 pending): 'As this artifact enters, choose a creature type.' is the EtBState effect CHOOSE_NAME(quality=CREATURE_TYPE), the choice made before the artifact enters (CR 614.12a), asked as a 'quality' decision over the format pool's creature types (cards and the creature tokens they make: executor.creature_type_pool); the anthem's selector and the reveal's filter read FAtom(NAME_CHOSEN, string_value=CREATURE_TYPE), this Icon's choice (CR 607.2d). The activated ability is Garruk's Harbinger's look, reveal and random bottom (templates_b4.reveal_one_from_among, MOVE_ZONE arrange RANDOM). The probe board chooses the first type of the menu, so its creatures of other types show no anthem: packs tools/scenarios/mapped/M20/icon_of_ancestry_*.json pin the anthem on the chosen type only and the reveal. Closes the needs-atom of 2026-11-05 (claude-mapper-m20-1)."
